Description

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:46.829
SCP 343 is a male seemingly raceless humanoid and appearance with apparent omnipotence

00:00:48.309 --> 00:00:55.799
SCP 343 was discovered walking the streets of prague and detained after a member of staff witnessed him disappear from the streets and

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:58.140
