00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:05.939
SCP 343 is detained willingly in his chamber as containment has proved impossible

00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:10.049
Addendum 343 - one

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:19.739
SCP 343 colloquially named god by the staff here looks like an older man. Although his features are different to each observer

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:24.330
In my first talk with him he claimed to be the creator of the universe

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:28.049
When I asked him to prove this he laughed

00:01:28.869 --> 00:01:32.938
Walked through the wall of the chamber and returned seconds later with a hamburger in his hand

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:37.859
When I returned for a second visit the previously bare

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:43.559
cell had been furnished in an upscale Old English style complete with a roaring fireplace and

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:47.220
Seemed many times larger than it did from the exterior

00:01:48.579 --> 00:01:54.509
SCP 343 greatly enjoys speaking with people and seems to have a knowledge of all topics

00:01:55.899 --> 00:02:02.429
Visiting with SCP 343 has become a daily event for many of the staff here and all employees report feeling

00:02:02.829 --> 00:02:04.829
generally happier after visit

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:10.710
attempts to bar staff below level three clearance have proven unsuccessful as

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:14.460
guards assigned to watch the room quit their posts saying

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:19.680
You know he likes company or shrugging when questioned

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:24.630
Since s CB 343 has thus far been harmless all

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:29.729
Staff have been allowed access and somehow they all have time to meet with them for as long as they need

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:35.519
